    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated on a corner, the property enjoys a wonderful dual aspect and features a larger than average open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, with direct access to a private balcony. The sleek, contemporary kitchen has been upgraded in recent years and provides an excellent space for both everyday living and entertaining.\n\nThe accommodation comprises two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes, complemented by two beautifully renovated bathrooms. The principal bedroom benefits from a stylish en-suite bathroom. Further highlights include a brand new boiler, good storage, secure underground parking, lift access and beautifully maintained communal gardens.\n\nThis impressive Penthouse combines generous living space, modern finishes and a desirable setting, making it an excellent choice for those seeking comfortable and stylish apartment living.\n\nWingfield enjoys a peaceful and secure setting within this mature and exceptionally well-maintained development. Residents benefit from an excellent range of amenities in nearby Stepaside Village, while the established suburbs of Sandyford, Leopardstown, Stillorgan and Foxrock are all within easy reach. Dundrum Town Centre, Sandyford Business District, Beacon South Quarter, Leopardstown Racecourse and Carrickmines Retail Park are also conveniently located nearby, providing an extensive choice of shopping, dining, leisure and business amenities.\n\nThe area is particularly well suited to families, with an excellent selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools close by. These include Our Lady of the Wayside, Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille, Kilternan Church of Ireland National School, Stepaside Educate Together and Rosemont School. Outdoor enthusiasts are equally well catered for, with an abundance of recreational amenities on the doorstep. Nearby hill walking and mountain biking trails, Fernhill Park & Gardens, De La Salle Rugby Club and Wayside Celtic Football Club all contribute to an active and enjoyable lifestyle. The location is further enhanced by excellent transport links, with easy access to the M50 and N11, as well as numerous bus routes. A pedestrian walkway through the neighbouring Stepaside Park development provides access to Stepaside Village in under 10 minutes, while the Cruagh Greenway offers a direct route to the Luas in less than 15 minutes. This combination of accessibility and connectivity makes Wingfield an ideal base for both commuters and those looking to enjoy all that the surrounding area has to offer.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining - 25'4\" (7.72m) x 17'8\" (5.38m)\n\nMaster Bedroom - 18'0\" (5.49m) x 11'11\" (3.63m)\n\nEn suite\n\nBedroom 2 - 18'0\" (5.49m) x 12'11\" (3.94m)\n\nBathroom\n\nStorage\n\nNotice\nThese particulars are issued by Mark Kelly & Associates (MKA) on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through us. They are provided in good faith for guidance only and do not form part of any offer or contract. MKA has not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, services or equipment, and purchasers must satisfy themselves as to their condition and working order. All descriptions, measurements, dimensions, maps, plans, photographs, condition, permissions, licences, access, prices, rents, outgoings and other information are approximate, for guidance only and may be subject to change without notice. Maps and plans are not to scale. Photographs are provided for presentation and guidance purposes. Where appropriate, AI-assisted enhancement, refinement or virtual furnishing may be used to improve presentation or assist purchasers in visualising layout, scale or potential. Such imagery is not intended to materially alter or misrepresent the structure, layout, condition or features of the property. Neither MKA nor its staff or representatives have authority to make or give any representation or warranty in relation to the property.\n"
